Component license guide (file-level notices and exceptions take precedence):

- winawdl: MIT, except components listed below; see winawdl/LICENSE.
- winawdl/airdrop: MIT; see winawdl/airdrop/LICENSE.
- winawdl/awdl and winawdl/upstream/owl: GPL-3.0-or-later, with
  separately marked exceptions; see their license files.
- winawdl/radio and winawdl/upstream/devourer: GPL-2.0-only, with
  separately marked exceptions; see their license files. In particular,
  winawdl/radio/radio_link.h is MIT.
- winawdl/adapter: MIT AND BSD-3-Clause-Clear; see the adapter README,
  source file headers and the accompanying license notices.
- crates/radio: MIT AND BSD-3-Clause-Clear; see its README, source file
  headers and the accompanying license notices.
- crates/radio/drivers/windows/mt7922: BSD-3-Clause-Clear; see its README and
  crates/radio/LICENSE-mt7925.txt.
- winawdl/upstream/owl/radiotap: ISC; see its COPYING file.

Other third-party dependencies, firmware, runtime binaries, assets and
trademarks retain their own terms. This guide does not replace their licenses
